<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#393939;"><p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"> </p>
<div>Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</div>
<div> </div>
<div><!--StartFragment-->
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><!--StartFragment-->
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody" style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Just following up to see if you’re ready to place your <strong>first wholesale order</strong> with <strong>Zig-Zag</strong>.</span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Our legendary <strong>rolling papers</strong>, <strong>hemp wraps</strong>, <strong>pre-rolled cones</strong>, and <strong>smoking accessories</strong> are proven sellers in retail settings like smoke shops, dispensaries, and convenience stores — and we’d love to help you get stocked and set up for success.</span></div>
<hr style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"/>
<h3 style='color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:"Segoe UI", "Segoe UI Web (West European)", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-style:normal; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0; line-height:1.3; margin:0; margin-bottom:12px; text-align:left; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)'><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: inherit;">When You Order Direct from Zig-Zag Wholesale:</span></h3>
<ul data-end="1181" data-start="802" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;">
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>No MOQ</strong> – Order exactly what you need</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>Free Shipping</strong> on orders $150+</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>POS Materials Available</strong> – Branded displays and signage to support in-store sales</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>Exclusive First-Time Buyer Offers</strong> – Let me know you're ready and I’ll check what promos we can offer</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>Dedicated Support</strong> – I’ll personally help with product selection or any setup needs</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"/>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you're ready to browse or place your order, you can get started here:<br/> <a data-auth="NotApplicable" data-end="1326" data-linkindex="0" data-outlook-id="b3ee1f66-3560-4e53-bed2-a6307be0023c" data-start="1266" href="https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwholesale.zigzag.com%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CDEspitia%40TPBI.com%7C20cc693a25104907fd4508ddc897f04f%7Ca45164e10759468195f23f2615616cfb%7C0%7C0%7C638887277076171553%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=jioM10dJu%2BNH8rpx7Rw0xHWijMoyVQyQequkXPZj%2BEc%3D&amp;reserved=0" originalsrc="https://wholesale.zigzag.com/" style="color:#ff873c; font-weight:inherit; text-decoration:none; font-style:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit; font-family:inherit" title="Original URL: https://wholesale.zigzag.com/. Click or tap if you trust this link.">https://wholesale.zigzag.com</a></span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Not sure what to order first? No problem — just reply to this email and I’ll help you build a starter assortment tailored to your store.</span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Looking forward to helping you bring Zig-Zag to your customers.</span></div>
<!--EndFragment--></div>
<!--EndFragment--><br/><!--EndFragment--><br/>
